  "loc": "Abstract, p. 1236; Section 2.1, p. 1237",
  "quote": "Ranking the participants of a tournament has applications in voting,",
  "note": "The main object is ranking the players of bipartite tournaments (e.g. students/exam questions, golfers/courses) from match results, via chain editing. It is not a procedure aggregating several agents' inputs into a collective decision by voting. Voting is mentioned only as a related application domain of non-bipartite tournaments. Coding stopped."
